    "html": "<p>A particle, travelling at a velocity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.995c\"></span> relative to the surface of the Earth, decays in <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\;\\textup{ns}\"></span> as measured in a reference frame where the particle is stationary. In the particle’s reference frame the Earth moves a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d_{1}\"></span> before the particle decays and in the Earth’s reference frame the particle moves a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d_{2}\"></span> before the particle decays.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d_{1} - d_{2}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"13\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-13\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"19\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-19\\;\\textup{m}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
